# Hub carousel and button row on beats: S3K, back to S2, S1, S2, S3K, S2, buttons (Setup, Playback/Recordings),
# back to Start, card, S3K, S2. Used for the pre-redesign prologue, the climax wall and the final hero.
# Key presses sit on the bed beat grid inside the take: frame = round(26.25 * beat), held 5 frames.
setup=hub
width=320
preroll=90
realtime-ms=8
frames=761
26 RIGHT   # beat 1
79 LEFT   # beat 3
131 LEFT   # beat 5
184 RIGHT   # beat 7
236 RIGHT   # beat 9
289 LEFT   # beat 11
341 DOWN   # beat 13
394 RIGHT   # beat 15
446 RIGHT   # beat 17
499 LEFT   # beat 19
551 LEFT   # beat 21
604 UP   # beat 23
656 RIGHT   # beat 25
709 LEFT   # beat 27
